  "Ein Wochenende am Panorama Compound. Gemeinsam fahren, Lines feiern inklusive Barbecue und Kaltgetränke. Das ist der Mad Mutti Jam.": "A weekend at Panorama Compound. Ride together, celebrate the lines and enjoy a barbecue and cold drinks. That is Mad Mutti Jam.",
  "Der Sonntag gehört dem Slopestyle Contest – und allen, die an der Line mitfiebern. 3 Judges. 400€ Preisgeld. 25€ Startgeld.": "Sunday is all about the slopestyle contest and everyone cheering along the line. 3 judges. €400 prize money. €25 entry fee.",
